msgid "## 2. Layerwise KV Cache Offload on Prefill"
msgstr "## 2. Prefill上的分层KV缓存卸载"

msgid ""
"For a combined deployment, Prefill TP must be greater than or equal to Decode\n"
"TP and divisible by it."
msgstr "对于组合部署，Prefill的TP必须大于或等于Decode的TP，并且能够被其整除。"

msgid ""
"Add the following options to the Prefill launch command. `MultiConnector` lets\n"
"`AscendStoreConnector` offload layer buffers to Memcache while\n"
"`SfaRemoteD2HConnector` exposes the same buffers to Decode:"
msgstr ""
"在Prefill启动命令中添加以下选项。`MultiConnector`允许`AscendStoreConnector`将层缓冲区卸载到Memcache，同时`SfaRemoteD2HConnector`将相同的缓冲区暴露给Decode："

msgid ""
"Do not set `sparse_kv_offload_config` on Prefill. The\n"
"`AscendStoreConnector` entry uses the following buffer options:"
msgstr ""
"不要在Prefill上设置`sparse_kv_offload_config`。`AscendStoreConnector`条目使用以下缓冲区选项："

msgid "The following log confirms that buffer reuse is enabled:"
msgstr "以下日志确认缓冲区复用已启用："

msgid "## 3. Sparse KV Cache Offload on Decode"
msgstr "## 3. Decode上的稀疏KV缓存卸载"

msgid ""
"On Decode, reserve\n"
"`decode_data_parallel_size * decode_tensor_parallel_size` consecutive ports\n"
"starting from `kv_port`."
msgstr ""
"在Decode上，从`kv_port`开始预留\n"
"`decode_data_parallel_size * decode_tensor_parallel_size`个连续端口。"

msgid "## 4. Start the P/D Proxy"
msgstr "## 4. 启动P/D代理"

msgid ""
"For multi-node deployment, advertise reachable addresses instead of\n"
"`0.0.0.0`. Send inference requests to the proxy port (`9000` in this example)."
msgstr "对于多节点部署，请通告可访问的地址，而不是`0.0.0.0`。将推理请求发送到代理端口（本例中为`9000`）。"

msgid ""
"| `keep_device_kv_cache` | Defaults to `false`. Debug-only option that "
"retains the full device KV cache when enabled. |"
msgstr ""
"| `keep_device_kv_cache` | 默认为 `false`。仅用于调试的选项，启用时会保留完整的设备 KV cache。 |"

msgid ""
"Layerwise and sparse KV cache offloading are supported only in disaggregated\n"
"Prefill/Decode (PD) deployments. Colocated Prefill/Decode serving is not supported."
msgstr ""
"分层和稀疏 KV cache 卸载仅在分离式\n"
"Prefill/Decode（PD）部署中支持。不支持共置的 Prefill/Decode 服务。"

msgid "## 1. Preparation"
msgstr "## 1. 准备工作"

msgid "### Prefill Nodes"
msgstr "### Prefill 节点"

msgid ""
"Prefill offload relies on memcache service. Here we provide a simple "
"guidance to launch memcache service. Configure `mmc-meta.conf`:"
msgstr ""
"Prefill 卸载依赖 memcache 服务。这里我们提供一份简单的 memcache 服务启动指南。配置 `mmc-meta.conf`："

msgid "### Decode Nodes"
msgstr "### Decode 节点"

msgid "There is no extra work to do on decode nodes."
msgstr "在 decode 节点上无需额外操作。"

msgid "Requirements and limitations:"
msgstr "要求与限制："

msgid ""
"- Shared-buffer Layerwise Prefill Offload requires Memcache and eager mode.\n"
"- `SfaRemoteD2HConnector` is the only supported connector to be used with prefill offload and decode offload."
msgstr ""
"- 共享缓冲区分层 Prefill 卸载需要 Memcache 和 eager 模式。\n"
"- `SfaRemoteD2HConnector` 是唯一支持与 prefill 卸载和 decode 卸载配合使用的 connector。"

msgid ""
"| `layerwise_num_shared_buffers` | Defaults to the number of cache-bearing "
"layers, so omitting it does not enable cross-layer buffer reuse. Explicitly "
"set a smaller count, such as `3`, to enable reuse. Independent layers keep "
"dedicated buffers in addition to this shared-buffer budget; unused slots are"
" not allocated. |"
msgstr ""
"| `layerwise_num_shared_buffers` | 默认值为带 cache "
"的层数，因此省略该参数不会启用跨层缓冲区复用。请显式设置一个较小的数量（例如 "
"`3`）以启用复用。除该共享缓冲区预算外，独立层仍保留专用缓冲区；未使用的槽位不会被分配。 |"

msgid ""
"- Sparse Decode Offload is currently not supported on 950PR&950DT Products. We are actively working on it to support it in the near future.\n"
"- Use disaggregated Prefill/Decode deployment and enable sparse offload only on Decode.\n"
"- The main SFA KV cache must use BF16. Packed main KV caches (C8 or TQ4) are\n"
"  not supported. INT8 indexer KV is supported separately through\n"
"  `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8`; it does not enable main-cache C8.\n"
"- Sparse Decode Offload supports DP and TP on Decode; CP are not supported.\n"
"- Sparse Decode Offload and `PreemptOffloadConnector` are mutually exclusive,\n"
"  including when the connector is configured inside `MultiConnector`. Use only\n"
"  one of these offload mechanisms on a Decode node."
msgstr ""
"- 稀疏 Decode 卸载目前在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品上尚不支持。我们正在积极开发，将在近期提供支持。\n"
"- 请使用分离式 Prefill/Decode 部署，并仅在 Decode 上启用稀疏卸载。\n"
"- 主 SFA KV cache 必须使用 BF16。不支持打包的主 KV cache（C8 或 TQ4）。\n"
"  INT8 indexer KV 可通过\n"
"  `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8` 单独支持；它不会启用主 cache 的 C8。\n"
"- 稀疏 Decode 卸载在 Decode 上支持 DP 和 TP；不支持 CP。\n"
"- 稀疏 Decode 卸载与 `PreemptOffloadConnector` 互斥，\n"
"  包括在 `MultiConnector` 内配置该 connector 的情况。在 Decode 节点上\n"
"  只能使用其中一种卸载机制。"

msgid ""
"The current decode offload use a different host pool compared to prefill. So"
" the configuration on decode node is slightly different. Add the following "
"options to the Decode launch command:"
msgstr ""
"当前 decode 卸载使用与 prefill 不同的 host 内存池。因此 decode 节点上的配置略有不同。请在 Decode "
"启动命令中添加以下选项："

msgid ""
"| `topk_buffer_size` | Device hot-buffer size. Defaults to `-1`, which "
"resolves to `(1 + num_speculative_tokens) * 2048` (2048 without "
"speculation). Explicit values are unchanged. For the default Copy-SFA path, "
"use a multiple of 256, at least `(1 + num_speculative_tokens) * 2048` and at"
" most 32512. |"
msgstr ""
"| `topk_buffer_size` | Device 热缓冲区大小。默认值为 `-1`，此时解析为 `(1 + "
"num_speculative_tokens) * 2048`（无投机时为 2048）。显式指定的值保持不变。对于默认的 Copy-SFA 路径，请使用"
" 256 的倍数，至少为 `(1 + num_speculative_tokens) * 2048`，至多为 32512。 |"

msgid ""
"| `dram_size_per_dp_GB` | Defaults to `110` GiB of host memory per DP rank. "
"It must hold the full KV cache. TP ranks share this pool while different DP "
"ranks use different pool. The whole required host memory is around "
"`dram_size_per_dp_GB * data_parallel_size`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `dram_size_per_dp_GB` | 每个 DP rank 的 host 内存默认值为 `110` GiB。它必须能容纳完整的 KV "
"cache。TP rank 共享此内存池，而不同 DP rank 使用不同的内存池。所需的 host 内存总量约为 "
"`dram_size_per_dp_GB * data_parallel_size`。 |"

msgid ""
"Note that users might encounter an error like \"Sparse KV offload "
"offload.initialize failed.\". This is mainly because the contiguous host "
"memory required by memfabric is not enough to allocate. Please refer to "
"[memfabric-prerequisite-"
"checks](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.html#step-1-prerequisite-"
"checks) for preparing the host memory. Or you can consider to use lower DP "
"size to reduce the required host memory."
msgstr ""
"请注意，用户可能会遇到类似 \"Sparse KV offload offload.initialize failed.\" 的错误。这主要是因为 "
"memfabric 所需的连续 host 内存不足以分配。请参考 [memfabric-prerequisite-"
"checks](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.html#step-1-prerequisite-"
"checks) 准备 host 内存。或者，您可以考虑使用更小的 DP 规模以减少所需的 host 内存。"

msgid ""
"Start Prefill and Decode with the configurations above. After both nodes are\n"
"ready, start the layerwise proxy:"
msgstr ""
"使用上述配置启动 Prefill 和 Decode。两个节点就绪后，\n"
"启动分层代理："
